{"_note":"App 检索(标准 §1.1「搜索型」的落点):App Store 的数据宇宙不可枚举,首页搜索框选中后把 {appId, name, country} 交给列表/addWidget。定长 8 槽结构化瘦身,理由同 watchlist.df(原始对象 10KB/个且含全空字段)。kw 由 JS encodeURIComponent 后传入。\n【G23 豁免】编辑页搜索流:用户敲了关键词才跑,不是首屏;搜索结果要新鲜,缓存有害。","version":1,"actions":[{"id":"resp","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://itunes.apple.com/search?term=${kw}&entity=software&country=${country}&limit=8","method":"GET","formatType":"json"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"total","value":"$[length::(${resp.results})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"list","value":[{"id":"${resp.results[0].trackId}","n":"${resp.results[0].trackName}","dev":"${resp.results[0].artistName}","g":"${resp.results[0].primaryGenreName}","r":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.results[0].averageUserRating},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${resp.results[0].averageUserRating},0.0))]"},{"id":"${resp.results[1].trackId}","n":"${resp.results[1].trackName}","dev":"${resp.results[1].artistName}","g":"${resp.results[1].primaryGenreName}","r":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.results[1].averageUserRating},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${resp.results[1].averageUserRating},0.0))]"},{"id":"${resp.results[2].trackId}","n":"${resp.results[2].trackName}","dev":"${resp.results[2].artistName}","g":"${resp.results[2].primaryGenreName}","r":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.results[2].averageUserRating},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${resp.results[2].averageUserRating},0.0))]"},{"id":"${resp.results[3].trackId}","n":"${resp.results[3].trackName}","dev":"${resp.results[3].artistName}","g":"${resp.results[3].primaryGenreName}","r":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.results[3].averageUserRating},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${resp.results[3].averageUserRating},0.0))]"},{"id":"${resp.results[4].trackId}","n":"${resp.results[4].trackName}","dev":"${resp.results[4].artistName}","g":"${resp.results[4].primaryGenreName}","r":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.results[4].averageUserRating},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${resp.results[4].averageUserRating},0.0))]"},{"id":"${resp.results[5].trackId}","n":"${resp.results[5].trackName}","dev":"${resp.results[5].artistName}","g":"${resp.results[5].primaryGenreName}","r":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.results[5].averageUserRating},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${resp.results[5].averageUserRating},0.0))]"},{"id":"${resp.results[6].trackId}","n":"${resp.results[6].trackName}","dev":"${resp.results[6].artistName}","g":"${resp.results[6].primaryGenreName}","r":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.results[6].averageUserRating},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${resp.results[6].averageUserRating},0.0))]"},{"id":"${resp.results[7].trackId}","n":"${resp.results[7].trackName}","dev":"${resp.results[7].artistName}","g":"${resp.results[7].primaryGenreName}","r":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.results[7].averageUserRating},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${resp.results[7].averageUserRating},0.0))]"}]}},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["list","total"]}}],"_lintCache":"exempt"}
